Cell["\<\
Change the time slider to watch the particle spread and interfere around the \
ring. The plotted heights are probabilities, not amplitudes; their sum stays \
one. The time variable is dimensionless, so a larger hopping energy means \
faster dynamics in physical time.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"25fd9883-e514-4c23-8d2b-9266d6d3bcfd"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  StyleBox[
   DynamicModuleBox[{time$$ = 8.67, Typeset`show$$ = True, 
    Typeset`bookmarkList$$ = {}, Typeset`bookmarkMode$$ = "Menu", 
